  "response_text": "Here a = 2, b = −3 and c = −1.\nDiscriminant: Δ = b² − 4ac = (−3)² − 4(2)(−1) = 9 + 8 = 17\nx = (−b ± √Δ)/(2a) = (3 ± √17)/4\n\nSo x = (3 + √17)/4 ≈ 1.78 or x = (3 − √17)/4 ≈ −0.281.",
